{#
| Variable                 | Type      | Description                                        |
|--------------------------|-----------|----------------------------------------------------|
| component                | object    | merchant settings from twilight.json               |
| component.title          | string    | heading                                            |
| component.subtitle       | string    | subheading                                         |
| component.products       | Product[] | the packages (merchant-selected)                   |
| component.show_quick_view| bool      | the card's quick-view eye (default on)             |
| position                 | int       | sorting block                                      |

«بكجات قصة» — Figma "Qusah Re-Vamp": desktop 326:565, mobile 290:7685.
The products section's heading (.qprods__head) over the shared Qussah card
(partials/qprod-card): two wide cards to a row on desktop, the products
section's two-column grid on phones. Hidden while no products are picked.
#}
{% set qv_on = (component.show_quick_view is defined and component.show_quick_view is not null) ? component.show_quick_view : true %}
{% if component.products|length %}
<section class="s-block qprods qbund" id="qbund-{{ position }}"{% if not qv_on %} data-qv="off"{% endif %}>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="qprods__box">

            {% if component.title or component.subtitle %}
                <div class="qprods__head">
                    {% if component.title %}
                        <h2 class="qprods__title">{{ component.title }}</h2>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if component.subtitle %}
                        <p class="qprods__subtitle">{{ component.subtitle }}</p>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            {% endif %}

            <div class="qbund__grid">
                {% for product in component.products %}
                    {% include 'components.partials.qprod-card' with { product: product } %}
                {% endfor %}
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>
{% endif %}
